Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:09:47.00,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单第三轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:09:47.00,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}³ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 凯斯 · 赛后新闻发布会
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.00,0:00:02.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:02.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.28,0:00:02.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Epic comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.96,0:00:04.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,史诗级的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.24,0:00:07.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么看？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:11.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it is a very very classic comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.24,0:00:11.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊 这是一次非常经典的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Especially I think the opponent
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.20,0:00:12.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是我觉得 对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.12,EN,,0,0,0,,has a match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.76,0:00:14.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,手里还握着赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.88,EN,,0,0,0,,That was also incredible performance
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.12,0:00:16.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这对我来说 也是一场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:17.96,EN,,0,0,0,,for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.88,0:00:17.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,难以置信的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:18.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.96,0:00:18.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.28,EN,,0,0,0,,One question each, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.88,0:00:20.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,请每人问一个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Howie?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.28,0:00:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,豪伊？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm curious just what it was like for you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.44,0:00:22.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我很好奇 对你来说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.16,EN,,0,0,0,,in that atmosphere cuz Madison
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.76,0:00:24.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,那种氛围是什么感觉 因为凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:24.96,EN,,0,0,0,,is obviously someone who's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.16,0:00:24.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,显然是这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.96,EN,,0,0,0,,a fan favorite around here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,很受球迷喜爱的球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,but you obviously
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.96,0:00:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,但你显然
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,had a tremendous amount of support there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.64,0:00:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,也得到了大量的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and it didn't exactly feel like she had a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉她并没有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:31.84,EN,,0,0,0,,home court edge at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:31.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,占到多少主场优势
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And just what was it like playing
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.84,0:00:33.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那样的氛围里打球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in that atmosphere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.28,0:00:34.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.96,0:00:36.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.76,EN,,0,0,0,,she was really tough opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.04,0:00:37.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,她是个非常难缠的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I think she also got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.76,0:00:38.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得她也有
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,a very very strong stroke.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.92,0:00:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常强的击球
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,But actually for me, when the crowd
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,但其实对我来说 当观众
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.68,EN,,0,0,0,,are supporting her, I feel also in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.88,0:00:44.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,在支持她的时候 我同时
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.76,EN,,0,0,0,,same time they are supporting me cuz
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,也觉得他们在支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.92,EN,,0,0,0,,as more noise they got,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:48.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为他们的声音越大
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like they are trying to wake me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.92,0:00:51.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我越觉得他们在把我叫醒
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:54.72,EN,,0,0,0,,What I'm afraid is the crowd is so calm,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.56,0:00:54.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我怕的是全场特别安静
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,you know, nothing happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.72,0:00:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,什么都没有发生
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.32,EN,,0,0,0,,But once they start
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.28,0:00:57.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,但一旦他们开始
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to supporting the opponent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.32,0:00:59.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,支持对手
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,actually I like those atmosphere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,其实我喜欢那种气氛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I like they supporting me also supporting
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.36,0:01:03.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我喜欢他们支持我 也支持
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,the opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.84,0:01:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,对手
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,This makes me really awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.64,0:01:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,这让我整个人清醒过来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:08.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations to you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.60,0:01:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You've had an up-and-down year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.68,0:01:11.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你这一年起起伏伏
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:11.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.60,0:01:11.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:13.32,EN,,0,0,0,,Did you feel when you came to New York
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.88,0:01:13.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你来纽约的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.56,EN,,0,0,0,,that you were ready
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.32,0:01:14.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有没有觉得已经准备好
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.20,EN,,0,0,0,,for a performance like this and a run
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.56,0:01:16.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,打出这样的表现 走进
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to the to the second week of the US Open?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.20,0:01:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网的第二周？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.44,EN,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:21.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.44,EN,,0,0,0,,when I decided not to play Cincinnati
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.44,0:01:24.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,当我决定不打辛辛那提
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and make a block of training with my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.44,0:01:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,和团队一起做一段集训
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:30.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I accepted that actually I really needs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.36,0:01:30.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我接受了一件事 我真的需要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.80,EN,,0,0,0,,to play quality in US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.28,0:01:32.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在美网打出质量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And then we've been working really hard
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.80,0:01:34.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我们在美网之前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.64,EN,,0,0,0,,before US Open to to try
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.52,0:01:37.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直非常努力 想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:40.16,EN,,0,0,0,,to make a good result here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:40.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,在这里拿到好成绩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,But actually I never think anything
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.16,0:01:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但其实我从来没想过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.40,EN,,0,0,0,,about result cuz I just wants
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.96,0:01:45.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,结果 因为我只想
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,EN,,0,0,0,,to fight every single match
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.40,0:01:47.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,拼下每一场球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and put the energy in each match and let's
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.36,0:01:49.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,把能量放进每一场 然后
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:53.08,EN,,0,0,0,,see what's happen cuz I felt what's happen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.72,0:01:53.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,看会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,in the past three four months is first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.08,0:01:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为过去这三四个月
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't have the right energy to play tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.88,0:01:59.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有打网球该有的那股劲
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:03.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and then second, maybe my level
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.84,0:02:03.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,其次 可能我的水平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.72,EN,,0,0,0,,or my body shape wasn't enough good
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.00,0:02:05.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者身体状态 还不够好
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to be in the top level, but after this block
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.72,0:02:08.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,站上最高的水平 但这段
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:12.12,EN,,0,0,0,,of training, I felt really I come back stronger
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.76,0:02:12.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,集训之后 我回来得更强了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:14.48,EN,,0,0,0,,physically and also mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.12,0:02:14.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,身体和心理都是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:16.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.48,0:02:16.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 凯瑟琳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.04,0:02:17.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,再次恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I just wanted given what you
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.40,0:02:19.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问 基于你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.60,EN,,0,0,0,,were saying a couple of days ago
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.04,0:02:20.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,几天前说过的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:23.32,EN,,0,0,0,,about how you you felt you'd forgotten how
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.60,0:02:23.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说你觉得自己忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,to compete, that that was the element
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.32,0:02:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,该怎么竞技
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.48,EN,,0,0,0,,of the game that took the longest
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.04,0:02:26.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是你花最久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to come back come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:27.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,才找回来的那一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:30.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I just wondered the way you won today
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.40,0:02:30.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道 你今天这样赢下来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:32.52,EN,,0,0,0,,from being 5-0 and match point down,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.12,0:02:32.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,从 5-0 落后 还面对赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:32.92,EN,,0,0,0,,I wonder
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.52,0:02:32.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:36.88,EN,,0,0,0,,if that gives you particular satisfaction given
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.92,0:02:36.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这会不会让你特别满足 考虑到
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:37.56,EN,,0,0,0,,the struggles you've
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.88,0:02:37.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在竞技状态上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:41.04,EN,,0,0,0,,had with those competitive feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.56,0:02:41.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,挣扎了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, like you said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:42.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 是 就像你说的那样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:45.04,EN,,0,0,0,,after coming back from injury,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.96,0:02:45.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,伤病复出之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:48.12,EN,,0,0,0,,it is true it's been a while I didn't compete,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:48.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我确实很久没有比赛了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:49.88,EN,,0,0,0,,so I felt I lost those energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.12,0:02:49.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我觉得自己丢了那股劲
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I forgot how to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.88,0:02:51.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,忘了该怎么竞技
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.56,EN,,0,0,0,,And then, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.96,0:02:53.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后 你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.84,EN,,0,0,0,,I play many matches here from the qualy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.56,0:02:55.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从资格赛开始打了很多场
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I have lot of emotions
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.84,0:02:57.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,我有很多情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.12,EN,,0,0,0,,when I'm playing the qualy match.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.60,0:02:59.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,在打资格赛的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I was even crying after I won
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.12,0:03:01.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,我赢下第三场
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:04.04,EN,,0,0,0,,the third match reaching to the main draw.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.52,0:03:04.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,进正赛之后 甚至哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.52,EN,,0,0,0,,And you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.04,0:03:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,而你知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.84,EN,,0,0,0,,main draw is just the beginning
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.52,0:03:06.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,正赛只是一个开始
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.28,EN,,0,0,0,,where all the players starts.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.84,0:03:08.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,所有人都从那里出发
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:11.24,EN,,0,0,0,,Also, that's just my beginning before.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.28,0:03:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,而那 只是我以前的起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:11.92,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I fight
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:11.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我拼了这么久
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:15.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so hard just to start like everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.92,0:03:15.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,只为了和别人站在同一个起点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:18.72,EN,,0,0,0,,And for me, that was really not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.60,0:03:18.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我来说 这真的不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And for today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.72,0:03:20.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,而今天
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:24.04,EN,,0,0,0,,it's like after coming back from 0-5,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.00,0:03:24.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,从 0-5 追回来之后
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:27.80,EN,,0,0,0,,the first things in that moment I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.04,0:03:27.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一刻我想的第一件事是
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.24,EN,,0,0,0,,please I I I don't want be beaten like 6-0.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.80,0:03:31.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,拜托 我不想被 6-0 打成这样
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I just wants to win one game
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只想赢下一局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,in that moment
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.72,0:03:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那个时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.92,EN,,0,0,0,,and after that the dynamic start to came
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.84,0:03:35.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,之后那股势头开始来了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and I felt better on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.92,0:03:37.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上感觉好起来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:41.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt like I can see the tennis better
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.84,0:03:41.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得我能把球看得更清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and then I felt I have lot of energy
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.48,0:03:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后我觉得自己身上
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.00,EN,,0,0,0,,on myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:44.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,有很多能量
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I can just keep pushing, keep fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:46.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我可以一直推 一直拼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,And at the end when I won the match,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,最后赢下比赛的那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.20,EN,,0,0,0,,it's like oof.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.28,0:03:50.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像 呼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's that's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.20,0:03:52.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 这太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:56.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Finally, one time the luck is on my side
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.60,0:03:56.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,终于有一次 运气站在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,because all these three four months
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.64,0:03:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为这三四个月
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.56,EN,,0,0,0,,have been suffering a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.16,0:03:59.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我受了很多苦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.56,0:04:01.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:03.24,EN,,0,0,0,,You just described how you felt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.16,0:04:03.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你刚描述了完成逆转之后
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.16,EN,,0,0,0,,after you completed the comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.24,0:04:05.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的感受
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:05.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:05.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:09.48,EN,,0,0,0,,What do you think caused that comeback?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.84,0:04:09.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得是什么造成了逆转？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.96,EN,,0,0,0,,What did you witness in Madison's game
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.48,0:04:11.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你在凯斯的比赛里看到了什么
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.64,EN,,0,0,0,,and what did you do in your game?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.96,0:04:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你自己又做了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:18.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I think Madison has a really strong strike,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.64,0:04:18.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得凯斯的击球非常强
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.76,EN,,0,0,0,,especially in the forehand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.76,0:04:20.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是正手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.72,EN,,0,0,0,,She can hit the ball super hard
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.76,0:04:22.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,她能把球打得非常重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and super fast, which is I didn't met
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.72,0:04:25.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,非常快 这样的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,those opponent before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.80,0:04:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我之前没有遇到过
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:28.88,EN,,0,0,0,,So, all the opponent I faced
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.36,0:04:28.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我之前面对的所有对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:32.48,EN,,0,0,0,,before, they didn't hit that hard as Maddie
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.88,0:04:32.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,都没有麦迪打得这么重
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and they didn't serve good as Maddie.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.48,0:04:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,发球也没有麦迪这么好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.80,EN,,0,0,0,,And I felt today in the beginning takes me
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.08,0:04:37.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天开场 我花了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.64,EN,,0,0,0,,a while to really realize, okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.80,0:04:39.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,一会儿才真正意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,this is the opponent I'm going to face,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.64,0:04:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要面对的是这样一个对手
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but luckily that I've been able
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:43.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,但幸运的是 我在第二盘
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.28,EN,,0,0,0,,to change in the second set,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,做出了调整
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:47.72,EN,,0,0,0,,so I give myself more time on court,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.28,0:04:47.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我给自己在场上更多时间
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,trying to put more spin, trying
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,试着多加旋转 试着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to play more rallies cuz I realized once
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.28,0:04:52.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,多打回合 因为我意识到
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the game start entering a long rally,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.20,0:04:55.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,一旦进入长回合
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.56,EN,,0,0,0,,can be benefit for me cuz my physique
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.20,0:04:57.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,对我有利 因为我的体能
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.36,EN,,0,0,0,,was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.56,0:04:58.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的很好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm able to run everywhere on the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.36,0:05:00.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我能在场上到处跑
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.60,EN,,0,0,0,,so I try to make the point longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我试着把每一分拖长
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.08,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.60,0:05:03.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.80,EN,,0,0,0,,But what did you see change
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.08,0:05:04.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,但当她大比分领先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,in her when she had that big lead
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,眼看就要赢下这场球时
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and was on the verge
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.52,0:05:08.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你看到她身上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,of winning this match?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.80,0:05:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,有什么变化？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.44,0:05:11.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 首先
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.00,EN,,0,0,0,,I have to say she started her set really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.36,0:05:14.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得说她那一盘开局非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I put a good first serve
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.00,0:05:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 我发出一记好的一发
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:18.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in and then she hits the ball just right
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.24,0:05:18.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后她把球打得正好
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.68,0:05:19.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,落在角上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt in the first three I really couldn't
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得前三局
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.00,EN,,0,0,0,,do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.40,0:05:23.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.04,EN,,0,0,0,,I just did what I have to do, but she hit
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.00,0:05:25.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我只做了我该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.20,EN,,0,0,0,,incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.04,0:05:26.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,但她打得不可思议
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And then suddenly,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后突然之间
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.04,EN,,0,0,0,,after I won the first game in the third set,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.36,0:05:30.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,在我拿下决胜盘第一局之后
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:34.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I see there's some like maybe doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:34.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我看到她身上有些犹豫
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:37.96,EN,,0,0,0,,or I don't know, not as clean as before.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.32,0:05:37.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说 不像之前那么干净
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.80,EN,,0,0,0,,She started to make a lot of mistake
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,她在那一刻开始
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in that moment and I started to feel like,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.80,0:05:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,出很多失误 我心里想
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.64,EN,,0,0,0,,okay, I need to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.00,0:05:43.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 我得守在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I need to keep fighting, don't give up
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.64,0:05:46.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得继续拼 不要放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.20,EN,,0,0,0,,and let's see what's going to happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.40,0:05:48.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看会发生什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.20,0:05:49.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 伊娃
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:50.84,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Qinwen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.84,0:05:50.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜 钦文
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.36,EN,,0,0,0,,You talked about wanting to kind
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.84,0:05:52.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说过想要
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.64,EN,,0,0,0,,of work on your physical conditioning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.36,0:05:54.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,加强身体训练
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:56.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and this is a lot of matches.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.64,0:05:56.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,而这是很多场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,How are you feeling physically now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.28,0:05:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在身体感觉怎么样
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:58.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and are you completely
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.92,0:05:58.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你之前那场病
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.92,EN,,0,0,0,,over over the sickness that you had?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.72,0:06:00.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,完全好了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,Luckily, I think today and yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,幸运的是 今天和昨天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I've been feeling much better compared
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我感觉比之前好多了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,to before cuz I remember
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.20,0:06:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我记得那几场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:11.24,EN,,0,0,0,,those few matches, I'm not breathing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.88,0:06:11.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在场上呼吸不畅
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I felt a lot of times I couldn't breathe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.24,0:06:13.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,很多时候我在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.04,EN,,0,0,0,,on court cuz my nose are blocked,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.08,0:06:15.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,喘不上气 因为鼻子堵着
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.28,EN,,0,0,0,,and my energy were really low.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.04,0:06:17.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,我的能量非常低
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:21.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, yes, after finally after 8 9 days,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.28,0:06:21.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以 终于在八九天之后
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.28,EN,,0,0,0,,my sick was almost gone, and I'm able
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:24.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,病差不多好了 我能
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:26.76,EN,,0,0,0,,to compete as my normal stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.28,0:06:26.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,用正常状态去比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Last two.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.76,0:06:27.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后两个
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:28.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.68,0:06:28.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,请 请
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.40,EN,,0,0,0,,just going to say, sorry. Harry,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.40,0:06:29.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就说一句 抱歉 哈里
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,just with the number of matches
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.40,0:06:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是打了这么多场
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:31.88,EN,,0,0,0,,that you played, tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.72,0:06:31.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,累吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,feeling super energetic, feeling good?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.88,0:06:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是很有劲 感觉好吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:35.84,EN,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.64,0:06:35.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not tired at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.84,0:06:37.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一点都不累
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, if I'm not sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.48,0:06:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 如果我没生病
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm not supposed to be tired doing all
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.72,0:06:41.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,打这么多场比赛
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:44.12,EN,,0,0,0,,those matches cuz honestly,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.24,0:06:44.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不该累 因为说实话
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.20,EN,,0,0,0,,the practice what I did in Bradenton,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:46.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我在布雷登顿做的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.48,EN,,0,0,0,,in Florida, that condition was super tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.20,0:06:49.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,在佛罗里达 那个条件极其艰苦
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:51.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Like every day when I finish practice,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.48,0:06:51.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,每天训练结束的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:55.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm sweating from up to down like totally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:55.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我从头到脚全部湿透
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.48,EN,,0,0,0,,And I need to make couple of changes.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.08,0:06:57.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我得换好几套衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.24,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't even want
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.48,0:06:58.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我甚至不想
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.20,EN,,0,0,0,,to remember the practice I made before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:07:01.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,回想我之前做过的训练
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.64,EN,,0,0,0,,Maybe that's because right now my fitness
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.20,0:07:03.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,也许正因为这样 我现在的体能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,are much better, and I don't feel tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.64,0:07:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,好得多 我不觉得累
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Especially when you keep winning,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.52,0:07:09.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是当你一直在赢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.52,EN,,0,0,0,,you just feel your mental is even more fresh
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.20,0:07:11.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你会觉得精神比之前
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:12.72,EN,,0,0,0,,than before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.52,0:07:12.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,还要清醒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:13.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Last two.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.72,0:07:13.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后两个
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I want and then wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:15.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问 然后等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:16.68,EN,,0,0,0,,Go first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.88,0:07:16.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你先
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:17.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay. Okay. Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.68,0:07:17.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 好 请
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,Hi. congratulations on the comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你好 恭喜你完成逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I want to ask you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.96,0:07:21.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想问你
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.52,EN,,0,0,0,,about the 4-5 game in particular.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.20,0:07:23.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,特别是 4-5 那一局
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.40,EN,,0,0,0,,You were down love-15,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.52,0:07:25.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,你 0-15 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,and then a baby started crying,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.40,0:07:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后有个婴儿哭了起来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and you had to pause your service motion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.80,0:07:28.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不得不中断发球动作
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:30.08,EN,,0,0,0,,So, in in that moment,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.52,0:07:30.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,在那个时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:30.84,EN,,0,0,0,,what were you feeling,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.08,0:07:30.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的感觉是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.08,EN,,0,0,0,,and how did you get out of that one?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:33.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是怎么走出来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:38.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, if it is a adult, probably,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.08,0:07:38.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,嗯 如果是个成年人 我可能
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:41.28,EN,,0,0,0,,I will look look at him very hard
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.04,0:07:41.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,会狠狠地瞪他一眼
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.28,0:07:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,or start to speak, but it's just a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.28,0:07:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者说点什么 但那只是个婴儿
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I can't do anything, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.76,0:07:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我什么都做不了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:49.04,EN,,0,0,0,,It's just a baby and that's that's can happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.64,0:07:49.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,只是个婴儿 这种事会发生
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:49.80,EN,,0,0,0,,In one match,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.04,0:07:49.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一场比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.44,EN,,0,0,0,,you have to accept the crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你必须接受观众
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Sometimes they're speaking loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候他们大声说话
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.88,EN,,0,0,0,,sometimes they can shout you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.04,0:07:55.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,有时候他们会朝你喊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.80,EN,,0,0,0,,they can start to coaching you on court.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,甚至在场边指导你怎么打
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.88,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, this situation it
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.80,0:07:59.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,我是说 这种情况
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.92,EN,,0,0,0,,been happening like many times before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.88,0:08:01.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,之前已经发生过很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I think as a professional player,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.92,0:08:04.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得作为职业球员
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.36,EN,,0,0,0,,the really good ones, we need to be able
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.48,0:08:07.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,真正优秀的那些 我们需要
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.44,EN,,0,0,0,,to handle those situations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.36,0:08:09.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,能处理好这些情况
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Okay, last question in English.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.44,0:08:10.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,好 最后一个英文问题
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:11.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.80,0:08:11.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.60,EN,,0,0,0,,You played us a match
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.00,0:08:14.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,大约三年前
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.76,EN,,0,0,0,,about 3 years ago against Bronzetti.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你打过一场对布龙泽蒂的球
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.72,EN,,0,0,0,,That was up and down at the US Open
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:19.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,那场在美网起起伏伏
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:20.68,EN,,0,0,0,,and you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.72,0:08:20.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And we talked about whether
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.68,0:08:22.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们聊过
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.20,EN,,0,0,0,,you actually like roller coasters,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.00,0:08:24.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,你是不是真的喜欢过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.52,EN,,0,0,0,,the actual amusement park roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.20,0:08:26.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,游乐园里真的那种过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And you said you love it
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,你说你很喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and you stay calm when it's
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且当过山车升到最高处
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,when the roller coaster is all the way up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,你反而很平静
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.88,EN,,0,0,0,,How do you stay calm
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.36,0:08:33.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一场像过山车的比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:37.00,EN,,0,0,0,,in a match that's like a roller coaster?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.88,0:08:37.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你怎么保持冷静？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.32,EN,,0,0,0,,And 3 years later,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.00,0:08:38.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,三年之后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.00,EN,,0,0,0,,do you still like roller coasters?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.32,0:08:41.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你还喜欢过山车吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.12,EN,,0,0,0,,That's a very funny questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.00,0:08:43.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这个问题很有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:46.32,EN,,0,0,0,,First of all, I think nobody like roller coaster
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:46.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先 我觉得没有人喜欢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.08,EN,,0,0,0,,during a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.32,0:08:47.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛里坐过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.60,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you can win 6-1, 6-2, 6-2, 6-3,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.08,0:08:50.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,如果能 6-1 6-2 这样赢
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that's the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:52.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是最好的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.00,EN,,0,0,0,,But if the opponents are really good
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.00,0:08:54.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,但如果对手真的很强
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.20,EN,,0,0,0,,or in that day you are not feeling good,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.00,0:08:56.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,或者那天你状态不好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.00,EN,,0,0,0,,you have to fight the match
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.20,0:08:58.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你就得在打得不好的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:00.24,EN,,0,0,0,,that you are not playing good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.00,0:09:00.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,把这场球拼下来
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.04,EN,,0,0,0,,That's the case cuz in one Grand Slam,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.24,0:09:03.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,就是这样 因为一项大满贯
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.52,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, it's 2 weeks
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.04,0:09:04.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,有两个星期
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.52,EN,,0,0,0,,and you can't feel good every single day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.52,0:09:07.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,你不可能每天状态都好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.00,EN,,0,0,0,,And I felt especially today,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.52,0:09:10.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得今天尤其如此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:14.04,EN,,0,0,0,,she Madison start the match very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.00,0:09:14.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,凯斯这场开局非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.96,EN,,0,0,0,,And in one moment, I felt I'm only
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.04,0:09:15.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,有一刻 我觉得自己
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.52,EN,,0,0,0,,in the defense position cuz she's
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.96,0:09:17.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在防守 因为她
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.96,EN,,0,0,0,,the one always attacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.52,0:09:19.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,一直在进攻
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.16,EN,,0,0,0,,But somehow, I mean, that's tennis.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.96,0:09:22.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但不知怎么 这就是网球
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Tennis is sometimes feels like roller coaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.16,0:09:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,网球有时候就像过山车
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:26.68,EN,,0,0,0,,You see many times
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:26.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,你见过很多次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.24,EN,,0,0,0,,the people they have a match point,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.68,0:09:28.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,有人手里握着赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:30.36,EN,,0,0,0,,but at the end we made a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.24,0:09:30.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,但最后被逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Like today was just happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.36,0:09:32.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,就像今天发生的这样
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.64,EN,,0,0,0,,So, this gives me also a lesson
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以这也给了我一课
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.20,EN,,0,0,0,,that in a tennis match you always
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.64,0:09:36.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,在一场网球比赛里
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,have to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你必须一直在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.60,EN,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter if you are winning
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.12,0:09:38.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管你是领先
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.48,EN,,0,0,0,,or losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:39.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是落后
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You have a match point
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.48,0:09:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管你有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:42.16,EN,,0,0,0,,or you don't have a match point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.80,0:09:42.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,握着赛点
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:42.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You just needs
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.16,0:09:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你只需要
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to be concentrate every single point as long
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.80,0:09:45.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,尽可能久地专注于
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:46.72,EN,,0,0,0,,as you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.84,0:09:46.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.22,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.72,0:09:48.22,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
